1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,862
N-ATLAS gives Nigeria a language model built for its languages and context.

2
00:00:04,812 --> 00:00:13,375
But an enterprise can't put a raw model call inside a real work process — there's no policy, no validation, no approval, no audit trail.

3
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:17,012
NEIOS is the integration layer that fixes that.

4
00:00:17,012 --> 00:00:24,162
This demo shows a real procurement request running through the full governed pipeline, live, on actual N-ATLAS inference.

